(F5 T3 C2: group_materi_plasti_mpc -yes, manual Professional 6.733: an
 element with a node in an mpc record is on a wall and its Mohr-Coulomb
 friction is reduced by the default 2/3. Two quad4; the mpc ties nodes 6
 and 5, which belong to element 2 only; phi, phi_flow and c are reduced
 {C114}. Node 1 {element 1} keeps sigyy -3.39353; node 5 {element 2}
 -1.87283. Professional 02-08-2026: -3.37319 and -1.87260.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
materi_strain_plasti
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 1
node 4 1 1
node 5 2 0
node 6 2 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 3 4
element 2 -quad4 2 5 4 6
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.3
group_materi_plasti_mohr_coul 0 0.5 1. 0.
geometry_line 1 0 0 2 0 0.01
geometry_line 2 0 0 0 1 0.01
geometry_line 3 0 1 2 1 0.01
bounda_dof 0 -geometry_line 1 -vely
bounda_dof 1 -geometry_line 2 -velx
bounda_dof 2 -geometry_line 3 -vely
bounda_time 2 0 -0.02 100 -0.02
mpc_node_number 0 6 -velx 5 -velx
control_timestep 0 0.1 1.
group_materi_plasti_mpc 0 -yes
target_item 0 -node_dof 1 -sigyy
target_value 0 -3.39353 1.e-4
target_item 1 -node_dof 5 -sigyy
target_value 1 -1.87283 1.e-4
end_data
